Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.27,Plansza,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\frx0\fry2\frz270\pos(368,132)}Wspomnienie
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.27,Plansza,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\frx0\fry2\frz270\pos(1512,140)}Wspomnienie
